AIFO + Release Tracker — Unified React Migration & Integration Assessment

Objective

Perform a complete architectural and technical assessment of the existing AIFO (AI Fueled Operations) application and the existing Release Tracker application.

The final goal is to:

1. Migrate the existing AIFO UI from Streamlit to React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS.
2. Preserve all existing AIFO functionality and business behavior.
3. Integrate the complete Release Tracker functionality into AIFO.
4. Do not maintain Release Tracker as a separate tool, application, or folder.
5. Create one unified AIFO application containing both the existing AIFO capabilities and the complete Release Tracker capabilities.
6. Ensure that no existing AIFO functionality is broken or lost.
7. Ensure that the Release Tracker functionality is migrated without changing its existing business logic.
8. Before implementing anything, thoroughly analyze both codebases and create a detailed implementation plan.

