28. Parallel Processing

The existing Java application uses asynchronous execution/custom executors.

Analyze where parallel execution is currently used.

Identify:

* Parallel GitHub calls
* Parallel component processing
* Kubernetes calls
* Commit analysis
* Other independent operations

Recommend the correct Python equivalent.

Potential technologies may include:

ThreadPoolExecutor
asyncio
asyncio.gather
concurrent.futures

Choose based on the actual workload.

Do not blindly convert Java executors to Python.

Explain why the selected approach is appropriate.

The objective is to avoid sequential processing such as:

Component 1 → wait
Component 2 → wait
Component 3 → wait
...

when operations are independent and can safely run concurrently.

